{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_B5EB0B96","title":"Fauxter","entry":"Dlg_B5EB0B96::entry","exit":"Dlg_B5EB0B96::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_C751372C","articyId":"72057778721544596","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Hey! I have your mixer for you. Put together a couple solid tracks with it.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey! I have your mixer for you. Put together a couple solid tracks with it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":-125.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33068","byteOffset":20393752,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_00FB4A65","articyId":"72057778721544617","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Of course you don't. You let me borrow it.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course you don't. You let me borrow it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":475.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25289","byteOffset":17450080,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_D72D3D32","articyId":"72057778721544624","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"I thought you did. Maybe it wasn't you BAYBEEEEEE! I am getting MIXED UP about the mixer.... Yaow! I guess never mind then...","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I thought you did. Maybe it wasn't you BAYBEEEEEE! I am getting MIXED UP about the mixer.... Yaow! I guess never mind then...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":1075.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38916","byteOffset":29053472,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_BC9A56ED","articyId":"72057778721544646","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Yeah! These things are PURE GOLD BAYBEE! Jacqueline Queue guessed on one of them. You know what that collab sounds like? Liquid grooves my friend. LIQUID grooves!","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah! These things are PURE GOLD BAYBEE! Jacqueline Queue guessed on one of them. You know what that collab sounds like? Liquid grooves my friend. LIQUID grooves!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1675.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38435","byteOffset":28874784,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_A0DF9E40","articyId":"72057778721544695","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Woah. Call me Captain of the Yacht Rock Club. What boat we jamming on? Wait, does it have a HOVA-pad? I totally wanna parachute from the HOVA to the deck baybee! Talk about an entrance!","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Woah. Call me Captain of the Yacht Rock Club. What boat we jamming on? Wait, does it have a HOVA-pad? I totally wanna parachute from the HOVA to the deck baybee! Talk about an entrance!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2575.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18582","byteOffset":14915976,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_53C6A23C","articyId":"72057778721544717","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"There's no boat?!?! How are we rocking yachts without the yachts? That'd be like trying to melt their faces in the shade!","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There's no boat?!?! How are we rocking yachts without the yachts? That'd be like trying to melt their faces in the shade!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23108","byteOffset":16627688,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_846F5E0B","articyId":"72057778721544730","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"What kinda boat doesn't have a HOVA-pad? Are we playing on the back of a paddle pontoon?","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What kinda boat doesn't have a HOVA-pad? Are we playing on the back of a paddle pontoon?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46918","byteOffset":32078504,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_E4A5E251","articyId":"72057778721544753","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Not... well... Once these new tracks hit I will! And now you got me late to the mastering session. Jac's gonna skin me.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not... well... Once these new tracks hit I will! And now you got me late to the mastering session. Jac's gonna skin me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3775.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25607","byteOffset":17571552,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_B151F16C","articyId":"72057778721544774","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Nah, I gotta get there. I gave my WORD! And if I don't have a word how am I gonna write songs? You need words to write songs. That's music science baybee!","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nah, I gotta get there. I gave my WORD! And if I don't have a word how am I gonna write songs? You need words to write songs. That's music science baybee!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4375.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45373","byteOffset":31498192,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_B0AF89C2","articyId":"72057778721544782","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Sounds familiar. I don't know, I don't know, I've partied way too hard on too many beaches to remember if I woke up on this one...","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds familiar. I don't know, I don't know, I've partied way too hard on too many beaches to remember if I woke up on this one...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3775.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18834","byteOffset":15011896,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_5639282A","articyId":"72057778721544796","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Send me the deets and I'll bring the beats. YAOW!","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Send me the deets and I'll bring the beats. YAOW!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4375.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30554","byteOffset":19439368,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_E2E5DC16","articyId":"72057778721544601","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player"